{"4258500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nuts and Bolts", "steam_appid": 4258500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the unique world of &quot;Sort the Bolts and Nuts,&quot; an addictive puzzle game that challenges your sorting skills across 30 levels of increasing difficulty. Perfect for casual gamers seeking a fun and engaging experience, this indie gem offers an entertaining twist on traditional puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Sort the Bolts and Nuts,&quot; you'll twist and turn nuts off bolts to match them with their corresponding colors. The game features multiple modes, ensuring endless hours of fun. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of puzzles, you'll find something to enjoy in this simple yet challenging game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 30 levels ranging from easy to expert, offering a progressive challenge for all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple game modes to keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intuitive gameplay that's easy to pick up but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sort the Bolts and Nuts&quot; is the perfect addition to your indie gaming collection. Immerse yourself in a world where precision and strategy meet fun and relaxation. Don't miss out on this exciting puzzle adventure!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the unique world of &quot;Sort the Bolts and Nuts,&quot; an addictive puzzle game that challenges your sorting skills across 30 levels of increasing difficulty. Perfect for casual gamers seeking a fun and engaging experience, this indie gem offers an entertaining twist on traditional puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Sort the Bolts and Nuts,&quot; you'll twist and turn nuts off bolts to match them with their corresponding colors. The game features m